 "paras": [
  "Welcome to the Art Institute of Chicago, home to a collection of art that spans centuries and the globe—and one of Tripadvisor’s “Best of the Best” US attractions of 2025. We look forward to your visit and invite you to ",
  "Mary Cassatt: After Impressionism",
  "Through January 3 Discover the bold and innovative work of Mary Cassatt in this gathering of over 70 experimental and ambitious works made at the height of her career. Tickets to this show are $7 in addition to general a",
  "Before your visit, pick the works you don’t want to miss.",
  "The best way to lend your support is to become a member.",
  "Explore thousands of artworks in the museum’s collection—from our renowned icons to lesser-known works from every corner of the globe.",
  "Discover the latest works to join our galleries.",
  "Discover the step-by-step process of conserving and installing a very large, very flexible work of art—one that puts our city’s history center stage.",
  "From books and notecards to jewelry and home decor, we have something for every art lover.",
  "Find all the information you need—plus helpful tips—to plan your visit"
